    <fullDescription>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[<p >Department: Talent Acquisition<br>Reports to: Talent Management Head<br>Employment Type: Full-Time</p>

<p >Key Responsibilities</p>

<p >• Manage the full-cycle recruitment process for assigned roles, including sourcing, screening, interviewing, and coordinating offers.</p>

<p >• Collaborate with hiring managers to understand role requirements and develop effective sourcing strategies.</p>

<p >• Maintain job postings across multiple platforms (LinkedIn, Wuzzuf, etc.) and ensure accurate, appealing job descriptions.</p>

<p >• Use ATS and CRM systems to manage candidate pipelines and ensure timely follow up and status updates.</p>

<p >• Conduct initial HR interviews and assess candidates for cultural and role fit.</p>

<p >• Coordinate and schedule interviews with hiring managers, ensuring clear communication with all parties.</p>

<p >• Prepare and send offers and support onboarding coordination when needed.</p>

<p >• Maintain accurate recruitment data, reports, and documentation for internal audits and HR tracking.</p>

<p >• Act as a brand ambassador by promoting Centro’s values and culture throughout the recruitment process.</p>

<p >Qualifications &amp; Skills</p>

<p >• Bachelor’s degree in human resources, Business Administration, or a related field.</p>

<p >• 1–3 years of experience in recruitment or talent acquisition, preferably in BPO, tech, or service-based industries.</p>

<p >• Hands-on experience with ATS/HRIS tools (e.g., BambooHR, Workable, Odoo, etc.).</p>

<p >• Strong communication and interpersonal skills, both in Arabic and English.</p>

<p >• Ability to manage multiple roles simultaneously and prioritize effectively.</p>

<p >• Familiarity with behavioral and competency-based interviewing techniques.</p>

<p >• A positive, can-do attitude with a focus on collaboration and continuous improvement.</p>]]></Value>
    </fullDescription>
    <jobTitle>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Talent Acquisition Specialist]]></Value>
    </jobTitle>
    <shortDescription>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Centro is seeking a proactive and resourceful Talent Acquisition Specialist to support our growing recruitment needs. You will play a key role in identifying, attracting, and hiring top talent across various departments, with a focus on delivering a seamless and professional candidate experience. The ideal candidate is detail-oriented, tech-savvy, and thrives in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.]]></Value>
    </shortDescription>
